&lt;p&gt;Many thanks to &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1346995&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607026567&quot; alt=&quot;Crayne&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1346995)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crayne&quot;  &gt;Crayne&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, who provided the basis for this using arcane computer majix, and &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129691&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607026567&quot; alt=&quot;Modern_Erasmus&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129691)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus&quot;  &gt;Modern_Erasmus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, who put in a frankly ridiculous amount of work getting this project off the ground. This list is currently run primarily by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607026567&quot; alt=&quot;MaliceAforethought&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought&quot;  &gt;MaliceAforethought&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;#8212; contact him if you have any list-related questions, queries, or concerns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;

&lt;p&gt;[[div class=&amp;quot;licensebox22&amp;quot;]]&lt;br /&gt;
[[collapsible show=&amp;quot;‡ Licensing / Citation&amp;quot; hide=&amp;quot;‡ Hide Licensing / Citation&amp;quot;]]&lt;br /&gt;
Cite this page as:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For more information, see &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide&quot;&gt;Licensing Guide&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Licensing Disclosures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607026567&quot; alt=&quot;MaliceAforethought&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought&quot;  &gt;MaliceAforethought&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-410160-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Wait to make sure your article&#039;s staying in the positive ratings (remaining at +1 or above for 24 hours) before adding the Task Force here: it&#039;s a pain to go through and clean up afterwards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-410160-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. If applicable, have a link here to the specific entry on the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-410160-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. For &#039;canon&#039; task forces, or those with individual hub pages, just include a link. Hubs take priority over the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-410160-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to write whatever here if it&#039;s your MTF, but try to keep it fairly unobjectionable if it&#039;s not. It&#039;s not mandatory, but something more detailed than &amp;quot;SCP-specific Task Force&amp;quot; would be nice!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-410160-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Clowns. They hunt Clowns.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-410160-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Ideatic unit representing an item within the confines of a language, analogous to a linguistic meme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
