kidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-309184-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Except the members of the O5 Council, who appear to be assured the effect of SCP-0000-D had originated from mass amnestization procedures, attributing the effects of SCP-0000-D from undergoing such.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-309184-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Though the death alert system has proven functional following the analysis of only fourteen universe deaths, plans to expand it are currently pending approval within the office of Administrator Verlaine.</div> </div> 
