						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>MTF-336 wakes up from break. He goes and does his usual things like getting a snack. He walks out to the hall to check his post.</p> <p>&quot;Im at 049 today? Thats strange. Never been there before&#8230;&quot;</p> <p>He walks over to his post, and waits. Nothing unusual happens, People walk by, the other guard comes, nothing else really. Suddenly the lights go red. Then the breach alarm blares. &quot;The he-&quot; the other guard tries to say, but is suddenly cut off by a lizard biting his head off. &quot;OH FRICK!&quot; he yelled. He starts running. Luckily, the lizard is interested in something else.</p> <p>The loudspeakers start blaring &quot;Everyone in site 19! Listen up! This is a mass containment breach! I repeat, This is a mass containment breach. Head to the nearest shelter!&quot;. The speaker cuts off.</p> <hr /> <p>Dr. Williams, a new scientist, had spent most of his spare time memorizing the maps. When the alarm turned on, he wasnt caught off guard. He grabbed a pistol, and ran down the hallway to the shelter. He heard screaming behind him, and dove to the side and covered his head. After he heard 096 go to the next hallway, he lifted his head up and ran like heck.</p> <hr /> <p>MTF-336 ran into the armory, along with a crowd of MTF and RRT and security. He grabbed a MPX and a Kriss Vector, and a vest of kevlar. He also grabbed 3 smoke grenades, and 1 regular grenade. He ran to the nearest squadron. They all ran to the doors of the shelter, guarding them.</p> <p>The general yelled &quot;EVERYBODY LISTEN UP! WE NEED A VOLUNTEER TO STAY OUTSIDE!&quot;. Everybody ignored him and ran inside. He cursed loudly then entered the shelter himself, leaving only MTF-336 out there. He swore loudly at them. He then went into a tactical position, waiting for something. He saw something coming down the hallway. Didnt know what&#8230; Until he saw the black suits. &quot;CI&quot; he yelled. He also saw somebody else in front of them, in a white suit&#8230;</p> <hr /> <p>Dr. Williams swore under his breath. He was spotted by two CI. He suddenly spun around and shot two shots. They both landed right in the head. He went over to search them, and took a bulletproof vest, and a G17. They must be rookies, they only had automatic pistols he thought. He heard something behind him. He looked behind him and saw a few CI. No wait. Its the whole ever-loving squadron. He up and left, running like a maniac, right to the shelter doors.</p> <hr /> <p>MTF-336 threw the grenade, then ducked and covered. He heard a loud bang, and multiple screams. He lifted his head, to see Dr. Williams right in front of him. Dr. Williams leapfrogged over him, and dodged into the entrance for the shelter. &quot;I need some help!&quot; MTF-336 yelled. Dr. Williams, who hadnt opened the door yet, ran back, and fired the G17. He took out one or two, and ducked back to reload. Shots fired back in a frenzy. MTF-336 Threw the flash grenade, then covered his eyes. Once he heard the bang, he looked back and fired the MPX. Once the mag ran out, he grabbed the Kriss vector, and took out 3 CI. Now all that was left was 3 trained conscripts and a commander. He was so busy shooting, he didnt hear the nuke alarm. He just noticed it, then got shot in the leg. He screamed in pain, and Dr. Williams fired a few shots.</p> <p>10</p> <p>He opened the shelter door</p> <p>9</p> <p>It slowly opened</p> <p>8</p> <p>The detoxification started</p> <p>7</p> <p>It was still going. &quot;HURRY UP DANG iT!&quot;</p> <p>6</p> <p>&quot;Detoxification complete&quot; the system said.</p> <p>5</p> <p>The doors opened slowly, as the back ones closed.</p> <p>4</p> <p>He opened the bunker</p> <p>3</p> <p>He dragged MTF-336 in</p> <p>2</p> <p>He locked the door</p> <p>1</p> <p>He hoisted MTF-336 over his shoulder and ran</p> <p>0. Alpha warhead engaged.</p> <p>He jumped into the box looking nuke safe house with MTF-336 on his shoulders and closed it.<br /> He heard loud rumbles, then a bang. Everything went dark.</p> <p>&lt;2 hours later&#8230;&gt;</p> <hr /> <p>MTF-336 woke up in the shelter, his leg in bandages and in a hazmat suit. &quot;Are you awake?&quot; one agent asked. He moaned in pain. &quot;Yes&quot; he replied groggily. &quot;Thats good.&quot; she said. His surroundings sharpened, as he woke up more. He stood up, then immediately regretted it. He heard the chatter around him. &quot;Can you believe it?&quot; one said. &quot;Its a DG class scenario.&quot; another said. Dr. Williams walked over.</p> <p>&quot;You okay?&quot; Williams asked. &quot;No. My leg hurts like crazy.&quot; he replied. &quot;Hm. So what happened is a DG class scenario. A mass breach happened, and a lot escaped before the nuke.&quot; Williams said. Everyone gathered up, and left. Immediately peanut wiped out half of their group.</p> <p>&lt;Two days later&#8230;&gt;</p> <hr /> <p>Only 5 were left. Dr. Williams, MTF-336, 2 scientists, and an RRT. &quot;Get in quick!&quot; He yelled. They all got into the jeep, one scientist manning the turret. &quot;WHAT THE FRICK ITS SO FAST!&quot; a scientist yelled. &quot;WHAT IS?&quot; Dr. Williams asked. &quot;GARFIELD!! ITS RIGHT THE- GAAAAAAUUUGHH&quot;. &quot;OH GOSH! GO FASTER!&quot; one scientist yelled. Then he was promptly decapitated.</p> <p>They were almost there, almost to SCP-2000. There were 20 miles left. Then they hit something. They hit another something, then a SCP-008-1 jumped up and tackled Dr. Williams. Who was of course driving the car. &quot;YOU WANT SOME LITTLE [EXPLICIT]? TAKE IT!&quot;. Dr. Williams then raised his G17 into its mouth and emptied a round. Another SCP-008-1 tried to jump the RRT. He quickly shot its head off. Then they passed something. It was big and white, they were going too fast to tell what it was. Nobody noticed it, except for the RRT.</p> <p>&quot;Hey, what was that?&quot; he asked. &quot;What was what?&quot; Dr. Williams replied. &quot;That big white thing we passed!&quot; he yelled. They all heard something screaming. &quot;OH [EXPLICIT]!&quot; the RRT yelled, as SCP-096 dive tackled him. It took a good chunk out of the backseat. &quot;PUNCH IT!&quot; MTF-336 yelled. They could see SCP-2000. They drove to the entrance, and skidded to a stop. They ran into the secret entrance and went next to &quot;The bloom&quot;. Somebody was waiting. Its an 05.</p> <p>He pulled out a gun and aimed toward the MTF and scientist. &quot;OI! Watch where you point that!&quot; Dr. Williams yelled. He lowered the gun. &quot;Why didnt you activate it?&quot; MTF-336 asked? The 05 said nothing, then shot MTF-336 in the head. Dr. Williams then shot him in the head, and something activated. Everything went white.</p> <p>&lt;40 years later&gt;</p> <p>Doctor. Williams was spending his time memorizing the maps. He just got recruited. But showed the 05's a note, and got promoted quickly. It read this:</p> <blockquote> <p>To whoever holds this</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>If you have this, then the end of the world happened. You are the survivor, and remember everything.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Nobody else will remember it. Whoever you are, you have been chosen.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>- 05-#</p> </blockquote> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7059423&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607026575" alt="Duccy boi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7059423)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" >Duccy boi</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
